### Temp-Voice Performance
1. Create temp-voice config with 10+ active channels
2. Delete configuration via dashboard
3. Verify all channels delete quickly and simultaneously
4. Check console logs for any individual failures

### Category Deletion
1. Setup temp-voice in a test server
2. Manually create a channel inside the temp-voice category
3. Delete temp-voice configuration
4. Verify category is NOT deleted (contains manual channel)
5. Check logs show skip message with channel count

### Rewards Route
1. Navigate to rewards section in dashboard
2. View rewards for a specific user
3. Verify 200 OK response (not 400)
4. Verify user rewards display correctly
5. Test stats and templates endpoints still work

